Test Data

SELECT RPT_YR, REC_JDX_CTRY FROM ctsg_enc.V_CTRY_TRANSMISSION;

SELECT E.RPT_YR, E.REC_JDX_CTRY, E.FCE_TIN
FROM ctsg_enc.V_EXT E
JOIN ctsg_enc.V_CTRY_TRANSMISSION T
  ON E.RPT_YR = T.RPT_YR AND E.REC_JDX_CTRY = T.REC_JDX_CTRY;

Expected Result

Query 1 returns the year/country combination(s) whose TRANSMISSION_FLAG = 'Y' (transmitted, status
message not yet received). Query 2 returns no rows, i.e. these combinations are not selected for
extraction.
